{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The 4K HDMI cable fits my television setup as a useful spare, and its extra length gives me more flexibility in placing equipment.",
    "The memory card and reader fit my recent camcorder purchase because recording and transferring footage are practical next steps, provided the card is compatible."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The HD Fire TV Stick duplicates equipment I already have and offers less resolution than my existing 4K stick.",
    "The Echo speakers, video-calling displays, tablet, and smart plug do not address a current need; my TV and camera purchases do not mean I want more screens, voice devices, or appliance automation."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Fire TV purchases seem to have been taken as interest in a broad range of Amazon and Alexa devices.",
    "Owning connected cameras and a smart television seems to have been taken as a reason to add other connected devices, even when they serve different purposes."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "What I already own matters: another streaming device needs a clear benefit beyond the 4K stick and Fire TV television I have.",
    "My recent camcorder and television purchases make compatible recording accessories and useful connections more relevant than additional standalone devices."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognized my interest in home electronics but leaned too heavily on Amazon and Alexa familiarity instead of practical additions to my existing TV and camera setup."
}"}
